OL,3,GNEWSATeen who died in crash was 'loved
OL,4,Abeyond words'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 18-year-old woman who died in a car
OL,7,Fcrash was "loved beyond words", her
OL,8,Ffamily has said.
OL,10,FMegan Durham was killed on 13 September
OL,11,Fwhen her Fiat 500 left the road in
OL,12,FWoburn, Bedfordshire, and struck a
OL,13,Ftree.
OL,15,FThe crash happened close to the Flying
OL,16,FFox roundabout in Sheep Lane at about
OL,17,F23:00 BST.
OL,19,F"Megan will be deeply missed by all who
OL,20,Fknew her," Durham's family said in an
OL,21,Fobituary notice, shared by Bedfordshire
OL,22,FPolice.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
